From: Unit OS <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: leave the dictionary tools out of cross builds

A cross build cannot run the dictionary tools it builds. Buildroot builds the
dictionary natively (host-anthy-unicode) and installs it with the target library.

Upstream: not sent (Unit OS, UNIT-OS-WP-0009)
---
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -74,11 +74,15 @@
 subdir('src-main')
 subdir('src-util')
 subdir('anthy')
-subdir('depgraph')
-subdir('mkworddic')
-subdir('calctrans')
-subdir('mkanthydic')
-subdir('test')
+# A cross build cannot run the dictionary tools it builds; the dictionary is built natively
+# and installed with the cross-built library (Unit OS).
+if not meson.is_cross_build()
+  subdir('depgraph')
+  subdir('mkworddic')
+  subdir('calctrans')
+  subdir('mkanthydic')
+  subdir('test')
+endif
 #subdir('doc')
 #subdir('alt-cannadic')
 
